 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY12-25 OCF $13.4B less capex $5.4B left **$8.0B FCF**. Dividends **$5.6B (70%)**; buybacks **$5.2B (65%)**; acquisitions **$9.0B** (Craftsman, MTD, Excel). Payouts and deals ran far ahead of FCF and were paid with debt.",
    "zh": "FY12-25 OCF $134 亿减资本开支 $54 亿，得 **FCF $80 亿**。股息 **$56 亿（70%）**；回购 **$52 亿（65%）**；收购 **$90 亿**（Craftsman、MTD、Excel）。分配与收购远超 FCF，靠举债支付。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted shares FY11 170M to FY25 152M, **down 11%**, mostly from the $2.3B buyback in FY22. Buybacks restarted in 2026 under a new **$1.0B** authorisation.",
    "zh": "稀释股数由 FY11 的 170M 降至 FY25 的 152M，**减少 11%**，主要来自 FY22 的 $23 亿回购。2026 年在新的 **$10 亿** 授权下重启回购。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Acquisitions built the company; the cycle broke it.",
    "zh": "收购造就了公司，周期打断了它。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Revenue rose from $9.4B (FY11) to $16.9B (FY22) through deals, then fell to $15.1B (FY25). The 2022 inventory glut drove OCF to -$1.5B and EBIT margin down to 2.2% in FY23.",
    "zh": "营收通过收购由 FY11 的 $94 亿增至 FY22 的 $169 亿，之后降至 FY25 的 $151 亿。2022 年库存积压使 OCF 降至 -$15 亿，FY23 EBIT 利润率降至 2.2%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The margin repair is working.",
    "zh": "利润率修复在见效。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Gross margin recovered from 24.9% (FY23) to 30.6% (FY25) on cost cuts and simpler operations; Tools & Outdoor margin rose from 5.1% to 10.1%. Q3 2026's 39% gross margin includes ~430bp of one-time tariff refunds.",
    "zh": "通过降本和简化运营，毛利率由 FY23 的 24.9% 回升至 FY25 的 30.6%；工具与户外利润率由 5.1% 升至 10.1%。2026年Q3 39% 的毛利率包含约 430 个基点的一次性关税退款。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Divestments pay down debt.",
    "zh": "出售资产用于还债。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Selling Infrastructure (2024) and CAM aerospace fasteners (2026) cut total debt from $7.9B (FY22) to $5.2B; net debt/EBITDA fell from 7.4x (FY23) to 2.7x TTM.",
    "zh": "出售基础设施业务（2024）和 CAM 航空紧固件（2026），使总债务由 FY22 的 $79 亿降至 $52 亿；净债务/EBITDA 由 FY23 的 7.4 倍降至 TTM 2.7 倍。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The dividend has been the anchor.",
    "zh": "股息一直是锚。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Dividend per share has grown 5.2% a year for 14 years even when FCF was negative; in FY25 FCF only just covered it (73%). The yield is 3.1% at today's price.",
    "zh": "14 年来每股股息年均增长 5.2%，即使 FCF 为负也未中断；FY25 的 FCF 只是勉强覆盖（股息占 73%）。按现价股息率 3.1%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Demand is the swing factor.",
    "zh": "需求是关键变量。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "DEWALT gains share with professionals, but DIY and outdoor demand follow housing turnover. My model grows sales only 2.3% a year to 2030; a housing recovery is the upside, a slump the bear case ($68.65). In my model the 2026 tariff refunds (~1.5pp) fall away, so Tools margin dips from 12.8% to 12.0% in 2027.",
    "zh": "DEWALT 在专业用户中份额提升，但 DIY 与户外需求跟随房屋交易。我的模型到 2030 年销售每年只增长 2.3%；房地产复苏是上行空间，下滑则是悲观情景（$68.65）。在我的模型中，2026 年的关税退款（约 1.5 个百分点）随后消失，工具业务利润率由 12.8% 降至 2027 年的 12.0%。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "My DCF is a little below the price.",
    "zh": "我的 DCF 略低于股价。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $101.85 (WACC 9.1%, g 2%, beta 1.16) needs $17.0B sales by 2030 at an 11.6% EBIT margin; TV is 75% of EV. At $112.92 that is -10%; the Street ($113.36) sits at the price. A 1.0 beta gives $112.81.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $101.85（WACC 9.1%，g 2%，beta 1.16）要求 2030 年销售 $170 亿、EBIT 利润率 11.6%；终值占 EV 75%。按 $112.92 计为 -10%；华尔街（$113.36）与股价持平。beta 为 1.0 时价值 $112.81。"
   }
  }
 ],
